    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FAQ answer writer from rough notes in a sheet\nTurn your rough notes into clear, customer-friendly FAQ answers, one per row.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b71ef06d-b2bb-55bb-a64f-e42e95c21df5",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **FAQ** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Fill the input columns (question, notes). Leave answer empty: the AI fills it.\n3. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and how many rows to process per run.\n4. Connect Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n5. Run once by hand, check the results, then switch to **Active**. It only touches rows where answer is empty.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d26564c5-ce99-5cb1-8c21-09089ae7abb1",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
